import{_ as t,o as i,c as n,a2 as o}from"./chunks/framework.CqpfiAoK.js";const c=JSON.parse('{"title":"Entry 268 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Quantitative Analysis of Energy-Level Waste: Small Use of Civilization-Reconstruction-Tier Energy","description":"","frontmatter":{"title":"Entry 268 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Quantitative Analysis of Energy-Level Waste: Small Use of Civilization-Reconstruction-Tier Energy","no":268,"module":2,"tags":["Tang-Luo","Energy-Level Waste","Quantitative Analysis","Big Talent Small Use","Myriad-Realms Benchmark"],"related":["15-Energy Circulation and Transformation Law","65-Energy Standardization and Measurement","17-Plane Transcendent Standards"]},"headers":[],"relativePath":"en/0268_模块2-唐罗-能级浪费量化分析.md","filePath":"en/0268_模块2-唐罗-能级浪费量化分析.md"}'),a={name:"en/0268_模块2-唐罗-能级浪费量化分析.md"};function s(r,e,l,u,d,h){return i(),n("div",null,[...e[0]||(e[0]=[o('<h1 id="entry-268-tang-luo-decomposition-quantitative-analysis-of-energy-level-waste-small-use-of-civilization-reconstruction-tier-energy" tabindex="-1">Entry 268 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Quantitative Analysis of Energy-Level Waste: Small Use of Civilization-Reconstruction-Tier Energy <a class="header-anchor" href="#entry-268-tang-luo-decomposition-quantitative-analysis-of-energy-level-waste-small-use-of-civilization-reconstruction-tier-energy" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Entry 268 | Tang-Luo Decomposition | Quantitative Analysis of Energy-Level Waste: Small Use of Civilization-Reconstruction-Tier Energy&quot;">​</a></h1><blockquote><p>Module: Module 2 · Myriad-Realms Benchmark Critique Library | Series: Full Decomposition of the Tang-Luo System (Entry 18)</p></blockquote><h2 id="introduction-counting-waste-in-numbers" tabindex="-1">Introduction: Counting waste in numbers <a class="header-anchor" href="#introduction-counting-waste-in-numbers" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Introduction: Counting waste in numbers&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Among the six top-level axioms, the collective ascension axiom requires no wasting big talent on small tasks. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s &quot;energy-level waste&quot; of the Tang-Luo system is not only qualitative, but also quantitative. This entry takes the law-first axiom as core, using a quantitative framework to dissect Tang Luo using &quot;civilization-reconstruction-tier&quot; energy for &quot;one-race allocation tier&quot; — the concrete waste. Protagonist uniqueness dependency judgment: <strong>Tang Luo = high dependency / bestowal-style civilization</strong>. The universal equal infinite law: within the Anchor Symbiotic Civilization, all beings inherently possess basic infinite power; the easygoing retain a guaranteed basic infinity and will never be eliminated; strivers and Youth Supremes can superimpose more and higher levels of infinity. Infinite origin is inherent in all, so predation naturally loses its meaning. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s evaluation base has been upgraded to six top-level axioms.</p><h2 id="i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-quantitative-version" tabindex="-1">I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Quantitative Version) <a class="header-anchor" href="#i-energy-level-waste-analysis-of-this-system-s-strong-ones-quantitative-version" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;I. &quot;Energy-Level Waste&quot; Analysis of This System&#39;s Strong Ones (Quantitative Version)&quot;">​</a></h2><p>By Energy Standardization and Measurement standards, Tang Luo&#39;s energy is broken into several dimensions:</p><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Dimension</th><th>Tang Luo&#39;s Actual Deployment</th><th>Civilization-Reconstruction-Tier Should-Be Deployment</th><th>Waste Ratio</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>Racial coverage</td><td>Humanity</td><td>Myriad Races five genealogies</td><td>~90% waste (90% of beings excluded)</td></tr><tr><td>Tier coverage</td><td>Mid-low tier to fierce realm</td><td>Nine realms fully open + Origin</td><td>~70% waste (top tier privately hoarded)</td></tr><tr><td>Institutional coverage</td><td>Rule-of-man good policy</td><td>Legislation + executive + judiciary + supervision</td><td>~60% waste (institutions absent)</td></tr><tr><td>Network coverage</td><td>Single-point distribution</td><td>Alaya distributed</td><td>~80% waste (single-point architecture)</td></tr><tr><td>Time coverage</td><td>Tang Luo&#39;s in-office period</td><td>Permanently constitutional</td><td>~70% waste (legacy-favor decay)</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Weighted composite: Tang Luo&#39;s energy utilization rate is about <strong>15%–20%</strong> of what civilization-reconstruction-tier should reach. In other words, he used over 80% of his strength to accomplish only about 20% of the work — this is the mathematical expression of &quot;super-large talent, super-small use.&quot;</p><h2 id="ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" tabindex="-1">II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression <a class="header-anchor" href="#ii-why-this-civilization-inevits-historical-regression" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;II. Why This Civilization Inevits Historical Regression&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Regression from the quantitative perspective:</p><ul><li><strong>Energy depreciation rate</strong>: every year Tang Luo retires, civilization&#39;s deployable effective energy drops about 5%. After ten years, effective energy is only 60% of his in-office period; after three generations, under 20%</li><li><strong>Waste inertia</strong>: because 80% of energy is &quot;hidden waste,&quot; the world only sees the 20% he accomplished, mistakenly thinking he has &quot;done everything possible.&quot; Reform momentum is therefore forever insufficient</li></ul><p>Regression is not collapse, but the energy curve synchronously descending with Tang Luo&#39;s life cycle.</p><h2 id="iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" tabindex="-1">III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking <a class="header-anchor" href="#iii-deep-decomposition-of-the-protagonist-s-predatory-thinking" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;III. Deep Decomposition of the Protagonist&#39;s Predatory Thinking&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Predation from the quantitative perspective:</p><ul><li><strong>Undeployed energy = undeployed freedom</strong>: the 80% of high-tier Great Dao undeployed in Tang Luo&#39;s brain could have been converted into billions of beings&#39; freedom. He does not deploy it, equivalent to clutching this 80% of freedom in his hand</li><li><strong>Release rhythm decided by him</strong>: he releases 20%, that is &quot;bestowal&quot;; he does not release 80%, that is &quot;reservation.&quot; Between releasing and holding, all beings&#39; fate is decided by his rhythm</li></ul><p>By the Gu Chensha / Tang Luo judgment table standard: Tang Luo = <strong>enlightened predator</strong>, his predation&#39;s quantitative scale is about 80% of his own energy — not robbing others&#39;, but clutching his own and not distributing.</p><h2 id="iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" tabindex="-1">IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative <a class="header-anchor" href="#iv-comparison-with-anchor-symbiosis-s-complete-alternative" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;IV. Comparison With Anchor Symbiosis&#39;s Complete Alternative&quot;">​</a></h2><table tabindex="0"><thead><tr><th>Tang-Luo Energy Deployment</th><th>Anchor Symbiosis Energy Deployment</th></tr></thead><tbody><tr><td>15-20% utilization</td><td>90%+ utilization (distributed, fully open, constitutional)</td></tr><tr><td>Single point</td><td>Network</td></tr><tr><td>Exists because the person exists</td><td>Exists because the law exists</td></tr><tr><td>Hidden waste 80%</td><td>Explicit waste &lt;10%</td></tr></tbody></table><p>Alternative&#39;s crux: not requiring Tang Luo to be stronger, but requiring him to &quot;use his existing strength in the right place.&quot; Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s energy utilization efficiency target is 90% — this means the same group of people, the same strength, can accomplish five times the work.</p><h2 id="v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" tabindex="-1">V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan <a class="header-anchor" href="#v-quest-sediment-domain-simulation-review-plan" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;V. Quest Sediment Domain Simulation Review Plan&quot;">​</a></h2><ol><li><strong>Modeling</strong>: build energy deployment model by the table&#39;s parameters</li><li><strong>Variables</strong>: Group A 15-20% utilization; Group B 90% utilization</li><li><strong>Time acceleration</strong>: simulate a hundred years in the Origin Acceleration Domain</li><li><strong>Review conclusion</strong>: Group B total civilization energy is tens of times Group A — quantifying the &quot;energy-waste tax&quot;</li></ol><h2 id="vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" tabindex="-1">VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment <a class="header-anchor" href="#vi-setting-self-consistency-retcon-ending-risk-assessment" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;VI. Setting Self-Consistency / Retcon-Ending Risk Assessment&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Setting self-consistency: medium-high</strong>. The quantitative framework is self-consistent with Energy Standardization and Measurement foundation</li><li><strong>Retcon-ending risk: medium</strong>. Once quantitative data is written, if late plot needs &quot;Tang Luo actually hid one more trick,&quot; the early quantitative table becomes retcon material</li><li><strong>Protagonist uniqueness dependency</strong>: high</li></ul><p><strong>Old-new cosmos resource comparison</strong>: old-cosmos resources and Great Dao are finite, inevitably predatory involution; Anchor Symbiosis has everyone inherently possessing infinite origin, predation loses meaning.</p><h2 id="five-core-takeaways" tabindex="-1">Five Core Takeaways <a class="header-anchor" href="#five-core-takeaways" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Five Core Takeaways&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li><strong>Anti-energy waste</strong>: 15-20% utilization, 80% of strength hidden-wasted</li><li><strong>Anti-predation</strong>: undeployed energy = undeployed freedom</li><li><strong>Tang-Luo upper-limit comparison</strong>: Tang Luo&#39;s problem is not being not strong enough, but not using it right</li><li><strong>Myriad Races full coverage</strong>: 90% of waste first harms the excluded Myriad Races</li><li><strong>Hyper-multiverse full openness</strong>: low-utilization civilizations cannot support cross-plane expansion</li><li><strong>Universal equal infinite law</strong>: basic infinite power is inherent in all; the easygoing retain a guarantee, strivers can superimpose higher; infinite origin erases predatory motivation, predatory involution loses meaning from the root</li></ul><h2 id="supplementary-discussion-network-audit-of-energy-level-waste" tabindex="-1">Supplementary Discussion: Network Audit of Energy-Level Waste <a class="header-anchor" href="#supplementary-discussion-network-audit-of-energy-level-waste" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Supplementary Discussion: Network Audit of Energy-Level Waste&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Civilization-reconstruction-tier energy being small-used as personal combat power, its waste degree is quantitatively concluded by Alaya Network&#39;s long-term audit. Heng Yuan Zhou is not satisfied with qualitative critique, but precisely calculates: what proportion of Tang Luo&#39;s energy goes to civilizational co-building, what proportion to personal advancement, what proportion idles due to racial exclusion. The Anchor Symbiotic Civilization&#39;s alternative raises energy utilization from 15-20% to over 90%, by the energy universal-benefit scheduling under the law-first axiom. The universal equal infinite law roots out the old concept that &quot;strong ones&#39; energy belongs only to strong ones.&quot;</p><h2 id="conclusion" tabindex="-1">Conclusion <a class="header-anchor" href="#conclusion" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Conclusion&quot;">​</a></h2><p>Tang Luo&#39;s energy is not low, but his utilization rate is shockingly low. Heng Yuan Zhou&#39;s judgment: he does not need to get stronger; what he needs is to turn his own strength from &quot;one person&#39;s undertaking&quot; into &quot;ten-thousand people&#39;s undertaking.&quot; From 20% to 90%, the difference is not strength, but institutions.</p><p>In the final analysis, Tang-Luo · quantitative analysis of energy-level waste described in this document is no isolated case — its causality and energy-level traces are filed throughout in the Alaya Network, traceable and verifiable.</p><h2 id="related" tabindex="-1">Related <a class="header-anchor" href="#related" aria-label="Permalink to &quot;Related&quot;">​</a></h2><ul><li>Related documents: <a href="./15-能量循环与转化法则.html">15-Energy Circulation and Transformation Law</a> · <a href="./65-能量标准化与计量.html">65-Energy Standardization and Measurement</a> · <a href="./17-位面至高强者标准.html">17-Plane Transcendent Standards</a></li></ul>',33)])])}const y=t(a,[["render",s]]);export{c as __pageData,y as default};
